    {
      "purpose": "channel-visas",
      "id": "1346509165798887538",
      "channelId": "1346508996667768853",
      "createdAt": "2025-03-04T15:46:42.057000+00:00",
      "editedAt": "2025-03-04T15:52:54.573000+00:00",
      "pinned": false,
      "author": {
        "id": "681333902740160598",
        "username": "emsenn",
        "kind": "administrator"
      },
      "applicationId": null,
      "webhookId": null,
      "flags": 0,
      "content": "Use this channel to pick which other channels you want to be a part of. *Meta!*\n\nEach emoji stands for a different topic: click it, you'll get given a role, and be able to see the matching channel.\n\nSome channels have their own rules and guidelines - make sure to check the pinned messages when you join, and anytime there's something new in them.\n\nAnyway, here's the list of channels you can join at the start:\n\n⚒️  :  Do you like to do stuff? Craft, garden? `#praxis-penisula` is definitely one to join.\n✊: Want to watch how the Islands govern themselves? We've got a set of channels where you can watch things go from idea to decision.\n💻 : Into computers? `#silicon-sandbar` is a good anchorpoint, but we've got a ton of specialized channels about digital stuff!\n💹 : Economics is another kind of tech we've got some channels for, starting with `#economy-estuary`.",
